cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'LASK: A Dataset for Laparoscopic Skill and 7-DoF Kinematics'
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it by its Zenodo DOI, and cite the MIUA
  2025 paper that introduced it where relevant.
